{"3802260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Backrooms: Flicker", "steam_appid": 3802260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Flicker</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1–4 players. Navigate a fractured reality with no clear form or end. Whatever's keeping you here doesn't speak — it simply waits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn’t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> — featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Flicker</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1–4 players. Navigate a fractured reality with no clear form or end. Whatever's keeping you here doesn't speak — it simply waits. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Scary atmosphere! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1 to 4 player co-op </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Proximity voice chat </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Immersive AI </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game Difficulties </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stealth </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Large &amp; difficult map </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Primitive but challenging gameplay </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn’t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> — featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>", "short_description": "Backrooms: Flicker is a cooperative horror game for 1–4 players. Navigate a fractured reality with no clear form or end. Whatever's keeping you here doesn't speak — it simply waits. Don't flicker, or you won't find yourself!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802260/9907c2c9d4da6c8729a9e5ee070893f82dec87f3/header.jpg?t=1761030237", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802260/e5e53cbb3f271e020205e8ef593f47edc7ec9bc5/ca